      "text": "A Queen of Spades, or QoS, is a woman who enjoys sexual intercourse with black men. She typically wears revealing clothing, often including tattoos or body paint. Her popularity is such that many websites and forums are dedicated to discussion of her activities. This term is also used as slang for a woman who has had multiple sexual partners of any race. It may be used as a compliment or insult.\nFirst developed in urban areas, the Queen of Spades is now found worldwide.",
