      "text": "Spellcasters capable of casting Charm Magic are greatly feared throughout society due to their ability to manipulate people's thoughts and feelings. Though some may use these powers for good, others use it for evil; using the power of Charm Magic to manipulate people into doing their bidding or becoming their slaves.\nFemale Spellcasters have a higher affinity for this type of magic than male ones.",
