      "text": "The 4 Corners is a strip mall located at the intersection of North Main Street and West Cameron Avenue in Southside. The 4 Corners houses several businesses, including a barbershop, a beauty salon, a liquor store, a pawnshop, and a convenience store. The 4 Corners is also home to many of the city's criminal activity, and has been the site of several shootings and drug deals.",
