      "text": "Aeros is the most popular strip club on the planet, with a variety of races and species from across the galaxy dancing, drinking, and having sex in its many rooms. Most of the dancers are female but there are also male ones. Some of these establishments may also sell sex or allow prostitution. Aeros is run by the T'zar Syndicate and is protected by armed guards who keep out any troublemakers that might disrupt the business.",
