    {
      "text": "Name:\nSophi, Russian wife to Igor\n\nType:\nCharacter\n\nDescription:\nA middle-aged Russian woman, married to Igor. She is deeply submissive and finds immense pleasure and a sense of triumph in the shared degradation of herself and her husband by powerful, dominant Black men. Her appearance is often meticulously maintained, from her blonde bob to her chosen attire, which she uses to present herself as an object of desire and obedience.\n\nBackground:\nSophi and her husband, Igor, were trapped in a monotonous, suffocating suburban life until they were introduced to a new reality of submission by their Black masters. This experience awakened a profound need within her. She misses the raw, visceral power and purpose they provided, finding her old life unbearable in comparison. She is an active and willing participant, often encouraging her husband to embrace his own sissy nature to please their masters and avoid punishment.\n\nSpecial Traits:\nExhibits a \"gleeful, triumphant fire\" in her eyes while being debased or watching her husband be humiliated, indicating she gets a deep psychological thrill from their shared subjugation. She is highly attuned to the power dynamics at play and offers \"gurgled advice\" to her husband on how to properly obey, demonstrating her complete acceptance and even promotion of their new roles as \"two white sluts.\" She and her husband will often coordinate their outfits and actions to present a unified, matching set for their masters.",
      "contextConfig": {
        "prefix": "",
        "suffix": "\n",
        "tokenBudget": 1,
        "reservedTokens": 0,
