    {
      "text": "----\nIgor\nType: character\nAffiliation: Russian Gangsters, Sophi's Husband\nDescription: Igor is the husband of Sophi, a participant in the new wave of sexual tourism and submission in Parallel NZ4529. He is a white man who has been completely subjugated by his wife and is actively being sissified. He is verbally and psychologically abused by Sophi, who acts as an evangelist for the supremacy of Black Masters. Igor is a key figure in his own debasement, which Sophi sees as her purpose. He speaks Russian and English and is forced to endure humiliation at the hands of his wife and her Black Master associates. He is a pathetic and broken man, but also a willing participant in his own degradation.",
